python3-pymcuprog (3.19.4.61-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Updated to pymcuprog v3.19.4.61 from PyPI
  * Implement context management for Backend (with statement support)
  * Add support for SAMD21 XPRO, AVR EB boot-row, dsPIC33AK512MPS506
  * Accept hex numbers (0x prefix) in read/write size specifications
  * Fix reads not aligned with USB chunk size (512 bytes)
  * Fix chip-erase-locked-device handling
  * Fix incorrect SRAM start address for AVR32SD32

